arrier\n- Break Plot (Shuriken) & Stick to Grabbed Part\n- Sparkler Sync (20+ Math Shapes: Planet, Tornado, Helix, etc.)\n- Bring Train (Driveable Train)\n- Auto Spin Slots (Coin Farm)\n\n[+] Figure Grab (Puppet Mode)\n- Full Limb Control (Position & Rotation Sliders)\n- Poses Presets (JojoStand, Poses 1-7)\n- Mirror My Animations\n- Target Spin & Float Oscillate\n- Freeze Limbs / Force Re-grab\n\n[+] Visuals & ESP\n- Player ESP (Box, Highlight, Distance, Rainbow)\n- PCLD ESP\n- Custom Skyboxes & Nebula Theme\n- Fullbright & Time Changer\n- Custom Character FX (Orbit Rings, Lightning, Fire Aura, Bubble Shield, etc.)\n- Black Hole Customizer (Color, Realistic Mode, Neon, Sounds)\n\n[+] Keybinds & Misc\n- Click TP (X) / Sit Blobman (Z)\n- Dog Pose V1 & V2 (T)\n- Quick Limb Removers (Arms/Legs)\n- Packet Logger / Notify\n- Black Hole Detection Alert","tags":[],"script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://pastefy.app/QQTExB7w/raw\"))()","owner":{"_id":"698367d9711cf3c9124dd08e","username":"KpacaB4uk_v_kedax666","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9a09ac8981fe520eaaa4a006b99d58118040d8c17b767c6dcf33a670b4f336a4.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/698367d9711cf3c9124dd08e-1791547758182.jpg"},"lvl":4,"status":"offline","id":"698367d9711cf3c9124dd08e","topMilestone":{"key":"creator.executions","tier":10000},"profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/9a09ac8981fe520eaaa4a006b99d58118040d8c17b767c6dcf33a670b4f336a4.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/698367d9711cf3c9124dd08e-1791547758182.jpg"}},"verified":false,"keyless":false,"views":15944,"executes":93938,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/618187470f60afdac97b2f243e11bd2cfd981fd87caadb73d33895cfff7ab772.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/6961824067-1789280493871.jpg","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/6961824067-1789280493871.jpg"},"likeCount":6